                "text": "Today, I visited Rice County and met with local leaders at both the Rice County Commissioners meeting and the Sterling Rotary Club. I appreciated hearing updates from the Rice County EMS and the Rice County Health Department regarding their efforts to keep Kansans safe. Additionally, I enjoyed learning about the recent volunteer work being done by members of the Rotary Club in the Sterling community. \n\nThank you for hosting me.",
