                "text": "This afternoon, I visited Smith County Memorial Hospital & Norton County Hospital and met with members of their staff. We discussed the life-saving health services they provide to their communities & my work to secure funding for rural health care facilities in the Reconciliation bill.\u00a0Thank you for hosting me and for serving Kansans.",
