                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It was great meeting with members of @kansashospitals while they were in D.C. this week. We discussed challenges that health care providers in Kansas are facing and my efforts to secure resources for Kansas hospitals through the Rural Health Transformation Program. Our health care providers are working tirelessly to keep Kansans healthy, and I am grateful of KHA\u2019s efforts to support them.",
