                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "On #RuralHealthDay and every day I\u2019m grateful for the health care workers who work tirelessly to keep Kansans healthy. Rural health care workers are vital to our communities, offering essential services where they\u2019re needed most and helping keep rural Kansas thriving. Thank you for all that you do.",
