                "text": "The Senate has unanimously passed my legislation to strengthen our national security and make certain U.S. veterans living in the FAS can access the health care and benefits they have earned through their service.\n \nLearn more about the legislation\u2b07\ufe0f\nhttps://t.co/ST8SzXwD0X",
